<title>FRANCE: Lapeyre first half net attrib falls.</title>
<headline>Lapeyre first half net attrib falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		   159  vs	     173</p>
<p>    Operating			    283  vs	     305</p>
<p>    Exceptional		loss     11  vs     gain     1</p>
<p>    Financial charge		     5  vs		 10</p>
<p>    Turnover			   2,543  vs	    2,499</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said in a statement profitability was at a &quot;satisfactory level&quot; given the current economic climate, that it expected sales to rise for the year and that it had a goal of maintaining a level of profitability little different to 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
